# Security Rules

## Secret Management

NEVER hardcode:

- API keys
- JWT secrets
- Database URLs
- Access tokens
- Passwords

ALWAYS use environment variables:

```typescript
const apiKey = process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY;

if (!apiKey) {
  throw new Error("OPENAI_API_KEY not configured");
}
```
